---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
// TODO: 정책 내용을 실제로 수정할 때마다 이 날짜를 직접 갱신하세요 (빌드 시점 자동 표시 X)
const lastUpdated = '2026-08-15';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | K-Entertainment, Explained"
  description="Privacy policy for K-Entertainment, Explained, including information about cookies and third-party advertising."
>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <!-- TODO: 실제 서비스에 맞게 검토/수정하세요. 이건 시작용 템플릿이며 법률 자문이 아닙니다. -->
  <p><em>Last updated: {lastUpdated}</em></p>

  <h2>Overview</h2>
  <p>
    This Privacy Policy explains how K-Entertainment, Explained ("we", "us") collects and
    uses information when you visit this website.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
  <p>
    We use Google AdSense to display advertising on this site. Google, as a
    third-party vendor, uses cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to
    this website or other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables
    it and its partners to serve ads based on your visit to this site and/or
    other sites on the Internet.
  </p>
  <p>
    You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting
    <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>.
    For more information on how Google uses data, see
    <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      How Google uses information from sites or apps that use our services
    </a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    <!-- TODO: 실제로 사용하는 분석 도구(예: Google Analytics, Vercel Analytics)에 맞게 수정하세요 -->
    We may use website analytics tools to understand how visitors use this site.
    These tools may use cookies or similar technologies.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us via the
    <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
